     ```

   - **`/opt/soulpilates/SoulPilates.Astro/src/components/admin/InstallPrompt.astro`**
     - Existing component handles `beforeinstallprompt` (Android) and iOS coach card
     - Stores deferred prompt as local `var deferredPrompt` — needs to be exposed as `window.__pwaInstallPrompt` for the profile button to access
     - This change was NOT yet made — it's the pending next step

4. Errors and Fixes:
   - **`System.FormatException: Element 'Seats' does not match any field or property of class Attendance`**
     - Seed script used `Seats` field but C# entity uses `Quantity` (with default 1)
     - Fix: `D.Attendances.updateMany({}, {$unset: {Seats: ''}})` — removed from all 180 docs
   - **Invoice Lines with wrong field names (`LineId`, `TotalPrice`, `Type`)**
     - `InvoiceLine` entity has `LineTotal`, `ProductId`, `ProductTypeSnapshot` etc. — not what seed inserted
     - Fix: `D.Invoices.updateMany({}, {$set: {Lines: []}})` — set to empty arrays
   - **`System.FormatException: Element 'DurationMinutes' does not match any field or property of class CalendarSession`**
     - `CalendarSession` entity uses `StartTime`/`EndTime`, not `DurationMinutes`
     - Fix: `D.CalendarSessions.updateMany({}, {$unset: {DurationMinutes: ''}})` — removed from all 127 sessions
   - **Mobile login "invalid password"**
     - Mobile keyboard auto-capitalize/autocorrect was modifying the password before the browser masked it
     - Fix: Added `autocorrect="off" autocapitalize="none" spellcheck="false"` to both inputs in admin login form
   - **PWA not installable on mobile**
     - Manifest `id` and `start_url` used `http://72.62.240.50/admin/` — HTTP raw IP, not installable as PWA
     - `https://soulpilates.com.vn` IS accessible (returns 200)
     - Fix: Updated manifest to `https://soulpilates.com.vn/admin/`
   - **Sidebar/profile panel blurred on mobile**
     - `.profile-modal-overlay` had `backdrop-filter: blur(2px)` causing iOS compositing bug where the modal itself appeared blurred
     - Fix: Removed `backdrop-filter: blur(2px)`, changed background to `rgba(0,0,0,0.5)`

5. Problem Solving:
   - Diagnosed all MongoDB `FormatException` errors by reading backend logs with `docker logs soulpilates-prod-backend`
   - Audited all seeded collections against their C# entity field lists to catch any additional unknown fields
   - Identified that `https://soulpilates.com.vn` has working HTTPS by `curl -s --connect-timeout 3 -o /dev/null -w "%{http_code}" https://soulpilates.com.vn` returning 200
   - The `InstallPrompt.astro` component already has a good implementation — the issue is the deferred prompt variable isn't exposed globally for the new profile button to use

6. All User Messages:
   - "Also fix the 'Group' badge in the instructor name cell which uses the class-based badge" [implied from session context]
   - "refresh the database and reload it with fresh demo data (clients, packages, classes booked, revenue, etc.) this will be for testing"
   - "Failed to load everything except for the clients. its all broken"
   - "failed to load schedule, classes and bookings"
   - "i created a new account for instructor nakko@soulpilates.com.vn and made the temporary password 'password' when i tried to login on my mobile phone it said invalid password, but when i logged into the account on desktop it worked. Also, there is no option to download the PWA app for mobile users, they need that application"
   - "i logged in on mobile okay, but i never got a prompt to download the app, also the sidebar is completely blurred out when i try to open it. Lets just put a install the app button hard coded when you click the profile icon on the top right"

7. Pending Tasks:
   - **Complete the Install App button wiring:** Expose `deferredPrompt` as `window.__pwaInstallPrompt` in `InstallPrompt.astro` so the profile button's `click` handler can call `.prompt()` on Android/Chrome
   - **Rebuild and redeploy frontend** after completing the `InstallPrompt.astro` change

8. Current Work:
   The work immediately before this summary was implementing the hardcoded "Install App" button inside the profile panel in `AdminLayout.astro`. Two changes were made:
   1. Removed `backdrop-filter: blur(2px)` from `.profile-modal-overlay` to fix the iOS sidebar blur issue
   2. Added the "Install App" button HTML and JavaScript logic to the profile modal

   The JS logic references `window.__pwaInstallPrompt` to trigger the Android install prompt, but this global is not yet set. The `InstallPrompt.astro` component stores the deferred prompt in a local variable `deferredPrompt` that needs to be exposed on `window.__pwaInstallPrompt`.

   The session was interrupted after reading `InstallPrompt.astro` at line 228 to find the right place to add `window.__pwaInstallPrompt = e` in the `beforeinstallprompt` event handler.

9. Optional Next Step:
   The immediate next step is to edit `InstallPrompt.astro` to expose the deferred install prompt globally. In the `beforeinstallprompt` event handler:
   ```javascript
   window.addEventListener("beforeinstallprompt", function (e) {
     e.preventDefault();
