message.content:
This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.

Summary:
1. Primary Request and Intent:
   - **HTTPS setup**: Get SSL certificate for `new.soulpilates.com.vn` (Cloudflare DNS pointing to `72.62.240.50`) and migrate the full system to HTTPS
   - **PWA install fix**: The install prompt showed "Installing Soul Pilates CRM" but never completed
   - **Data not loading system-wide**: After domain migration, all API calls failed (blueprints, settings, clients, products, invoices)
   - **Redirect to old IP**: System kept redirecting to `72.62.240.50` instead of `https://new.soulpilates.com.vn`
   - **Checkout JS error**: `Cannot set properties of null (setting 'textContent')` alert on "Continue to Payment"
   - **PWA freezing**: App freezes especially on POS page — user wanted PWA redone completely
   - **Push notifications**: Enabled in UI but not delivering
   - **POS page freeze**: Specifically when going to the POS page
   - **Checkout redirect loop**: "When i try to book a class and click continue to payment it just redirects me to the same checkout page" — currently being investigated

2. Key Technical Concepts:
   - **.NET 10 + Astro 6 + MongoDB** CRM at `/opt/soulpilates/`
   - **Docker Compose production**: `docker compose -f docker-compose.prod.yml --env-file prod.env`
   - **Frontend rebuild**: Always uses `--build-arg PUBLIC_API_URL=https://new.soulpilates.com.vn`
   - **Let's Encrypt / certbot**: Used `--webroot -w /var/www/html` authenticator; `--nginx` caused key mismatch
   - **nginx proxy_redirect**: Needed to rewrite inner container's `http://` Location headers to `https://`
   - **absolute_redirect off**: Nginx directive to emit relative Location headers instead of absolute ones
   - **PWA manifest `id`/`start_url`**: Must be relative paths or match current origin exactly for install to work
   - **Service worker versioning**: `SW_VERSION` must be bumped on every build to invalidate old caches
   - **Service worker fetch interception**: Complex caching strategies (networkFirstWithTimeout, staleWhileRevalidate) cause mobile freezes
   - **O(n²) calendar rendering**: Pre-bucketing sessions into a Map reduced 5,600+ comparisons to 112 map lookups
   - **backdrop-filter blur**: GPU-intensive on mobile; disabled via `@media (max-width: 768px)`
   - **Infinite CSS animation**: `pos-unpaid-pulse` running on all unpaid sessions simultaneously; disabled on mobile
   - **JWT auth**: Tokens valid 7 days, signed with `JWT_SECRET` from prod.env, per-origin localStorage
   - **VAPID keys**: Required for Web Push; set in prod.env; subscribe call requires valid auth token
   - **localStorage per-origin**: Tokens from `http://72.62.240.50` don't carry to `https://new.soulpilates.com.vn`

3. Files and Code Sections:

   - **`/etc/nginx/sites-available/soulpilates`**
