//   value() — how to render the value for display
//   raw()   — the comparable numeric magnitude used for delta math
//   delta() — how to render the ABSOLUTE change between the two months
// `raw`/`delta` are split out because occupancy is stored as a 0..1
// fraction but shown as a whole percentage, so its delta reads as points.
